                <p class="text-tagline-3 uppercase tracking-widest font-medium text-white/40">Want this tracked automatically?</p>
                <h2 class="text-white text-heading-4">See project budget vs actual — in real time</h2>
                <p class="text-white/60 text-tagline-1 max-w-[520px]">
                  Insighty tracks estimated vs actual hours, project margin, and cost overruns across every engagement. Spot overruns while you can still act on them — not in the post-mortem.
                </p>
